<title>UK: Mersey Docks in 35 mln stg port joint deal.</title>
<headline>Mersey Docks in 35 mln stg port joint deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Mersey Docks and Harbour Conmpany said on Wednesday that its subsidiary Port of Sheerness Ltd had agreed to set up a fruit cargo terminal joint venture with Fresh Fruit Services Ltd and South African fruit shipper Capespan International Plc.</p>
<p>The storage and distribution complex will cost 35 million stg, Mersey Docks said in a statement.</p>
</text>
